:answer-field/choices "answer-a7154eb4-bcc0-5f39-b2ae-a197b10dfcda"] ["answer-field-9c4e1c8c-757e-5673-8cd0-b270c0c3c7e0" :answer-field/choices "answer-d548f9e6-0754-56f7-b875-8b2dee34bc68"] ["answer-field-9c4e1c8c-757e-5673-8cd0-b270c0c3c7e0" :answer-field/choices "answer-395065b4-ace6-5290-9bf5-9ae34338d260"] ["answer-field-9c4e1c8c-757e-5673-8cd0-b270c0c3c7e0" :answer-field/choices "answer-e8c5a65a-fc58-5834-95f8-09e9880a2408"] ["answer-field-9c4e1c8c-757e-5673-8cd0-b270c0c3c7e0" :answer-field/choices "answer-d1260309-ef28-5201-b8ae-5cf3e6edba2b"] ["question-378ecb1a-5423-57cf-9a92-70fe30005016" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-9c4e1c8c-757e-5673-8cd0-b270c0c3c7e0"] [17592186204079 :knowledge-point/questions "question-378ecb1a-5423-57cf-9a92-70fe30005016"] ["question-35662c2c-d0a2-5e1c-b319-cae7bd255ca0" :question/id #uuid "35662c2c-d0a2-5e1c-b319-cae7bd255ca0"] ["question-35662c2c-d0a2-5e1c-b319-cae7bd255ca0" :question/math-academy-id "q-265777"] ["question-35662c2c-d0a2-5e1c-b319-cae7bd255ca0" :question/problem "Consider the function $f:{R}^{2\\times 2}\\to R$ defined by \n\n$$\nf(X)=(det(X))^{2}.\n$$\n\n \n\nWhat is the gradient of $f$ with respect to $X$ at $X=[\\begin{aligned}4 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{aligned}]?$"] ["question-35662c2c-d0a2-5e1c-b319-cae7bd255ca0" :question/worked-solution "The gradient of a function $f:{R}^{m\\times n}\\to R$ with respect to a matrix $X\\in {R}^{m\\times n}$ is\n\n$$\n{∇}_{X}f(X)=[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂{x}_{11}} & \\frac{∂f}{∂{x}_{12}} & ⋯ & \\frac{∂f}{∂{x}_{1n}} \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂{x}_{21}} & \\frac{∂f}{∂{x}_{22}} & ⋯ & \\frac{∂f}{∂{x}_{2n}} \\\\ ⋮ & ⋮ & ⋱ & ⋮ \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂{x}_{m1}} & \\frac{∂f}{∂{x}_{m2}} & ⋯ & \\frac{∂f}{∂{x}_{mn}}\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nIn our case, writing out the function $f(X)$ where $X=[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{11} & {x}_{12} \\\\ {x}_{21} & {x}_{22}\\end{aligned}]\\in {R}^{2\\times 2}$, we get\n\n$$\nf(X)=(det(X))^{2}=({x}_{11}{x}_{22}-{x}_{12}{x}_{21})^{2}.\n$$\n\nSo, the gradient is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\,\\,\\,{∇}_{X}f(X) & =[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂f}{∂{x}_{11}} & \\frac{∂f}{∂{x}_{12}} \\\\ \\frac{∂f}{∂{x}_{21}} & \\frac{∂f}{∂{x}_{22}}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂}{∂{x}_{11}}({x}_{11}{x}_{22}-{x}_{12}{x}_{21})^{2} & \\frac{∂}{∂{x}_{12}}({x}_{11}{x}_{22}-{x}_{12}{x}_{21})^{2} \\\\ \\frac{∂}{∂{x}_{21}}({x}_{11}{x}_{22}-{x}_{12}{x}_{21})^{2} & \\frac{∂}{∂{x}_{22}}({x}_{11}{x}_{22}-{x}_{12}{x}_{21})^{2}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2({x}_{11}{x}_{22}-{x}_{12}{x}_{21})\\cdot {x}_{22} & 2({x}_{11}{x}_{22}-{x}_{12}{x}_{21})\\cdot (-{x}_{21}) \\\\ 2({x}_{11}{x}_{22}-{x}_{12}{x}_{21})\\cdot (-{x}_{12}) & 2({x}_{11}{x}_{22}-{x}_{12}{x}_{21})\\cdot {x}_{11}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =2({x}_{11}{x}_{22}-{x}_{12}{x}_{21})[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{22} & -{x}_{21} \\\\ -{x}_{12} & {x}_{11}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =2det(X)[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{22} & -{x}_{21} \\\\ -{x}_{12} & {x}_{11}\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEvaluating at $X=[\\begin{aligned}4 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{aligned}],$ we get\n\n$$\n{∇}_{X}f(X)=2(4\\cdot 1-(-1)\\cdot 3)[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 \\\\ 1 & 4\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}14 & -42 \\\\ 14 & 56\\end{aligned}].\n$$"] ["question-35662c2c-d0a2-5e1c-b319-cae7bd255ca0" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] ["answer-field-51ec136b-c0f0-5734-828b-fc93c68cab5a" :answer-field/id #uuid "51ec136b-c0f0-5734-828b-fc93c68cab5a"] ["answer-d975b5e6-4b40-557d-ac26-27b4762c7188" :answer/id #uuid "d975b5e6-4b40-557d-ac26-27b4762c7188"] ["answer-d975b5e6-4b40-557d-ac26-27b4762c7188" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-d975b5e6-4b40-557d-ac26-27b4762c7188" :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}14 & -42 \\\\ 14 & 56\\end{aligned}]"] ["answer-90d505d3-8405-52e7-b05e-824d062628e6" :answer/id #uuid "90d505d3-8405-52e7-b05e-824d062628e6"] ["answer-90d505d3-8405-52e7-b05e-824d062628e6" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-90d505d3-8405-52e7-b05e-824d062628e6" :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}14 & 42 \\\\ -14 & 56\\end{ali